B.bfF=s(["Start at subcostal 12 O'clock position","Tilt probe to modified 3 O'clock, slight rightward tilt toward shoulder","Identify SVC entering right atrium","Add colour Doppler, choose low scale","Beware of simultaneous L\u2013R shunt through PFO \u2014 this can contaminate the signal","Place PWD sample gate just inside SVC-RA junction","Record at least three (ideally five) respiratory cycles","Include the negative wave in VTI calculation","Calculate SVC flow: VTI \xd7 \u03c0(d/2)\xb2 \xd7 HR \xf7 weight(kg) in mL/kg/min"],t.s)
