B.bFU=s(["Subcostal position, head tilt toward thorax","Add colour Doppler at moderate scale (30\u201350 cm/s)","Identify PFO in interatrial septum","Place PWD gate at the PFO","Determine direction of shunt: L\u2192R (blue) or R\u2192L (red)","Note velocity and pattern"],t.s)
