B.bBQ=s(["Subcostal position, slight left tilt to visualise abdominal aorta in long axis","Vertebra should appear near, running anterior to aorta, fully seen","First branch off aorta = celiac trunk; follow by SMA","Reduce scale to 30\u201350 cm/s (moderate colour Doppler)","Place PWD gate in proximal portion of vessel",u.eq],t.s)
